    "markdown_link_line": "Israel and Qatar had [no formal diplomatic relations](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Israel%E2%80%93Qatar_relations). An Israeli ex-prime minister could not simply call a Qatari royal to pitch a surveillance technology deal. But he could, apparently, have Jeffrey Epstein make the introduction. Barak's own words when Epstein connected them two months earlier: \"Glad to be e-introduced to you by JE. A great friend.\" <sup class=\"citation\"><a href=\"https://jmail.world/thread/EFTA02609150?view=inbox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Source N: EFTA02609150\">N</a></sup>",
